msgstr "ຮູດນິ້ວມືໃສ່ເຄື່ອງອ່ານ"

#: capplets/about-me/mate-about-me-fingerprint.c:809
msgid "Place finger on reader"
msgstr "ວາງນິ້ວມືໃສ່ເຄື່ອງອ່ານ"

