msgstr "ຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນສຳເລັດ!"

#: capplets/about-me/mate-about-me-password.c:491
#: capplets/about-me/mate-about-me-password.c:579
msgid ""
"Your password has been changed since you initially authenticated! Please re-"
